   "part": "PART 1 Prohibitions, Obligations and Offences",
   "heading": "Prohibited sales",
   "instrument": "Cannabis Act"
  },
  {
   "id": "cannabis-act-s34",
   "number": "34",
   "text": "(1) Unless authorized under this Act, it is prohibited to sell any mixture of substances that contains cannabis and any substance that is referred to in column 1 of Schedule 5. (2) Subsection (1) does not apply in respect of a mixture of substances that contains a substance that is referred to in column 1 of Schedule 5 and any cannabis of a class of cannabis that is referred to in column 2 of that Schedule in respect of that substance.",
   "part": "PART 1 Prohibitions, Obligations and Offences",
   "heading": "Prohibited substances",
   "instrument": "Cannabis Act"
  },
  {
   "id": "cannabis-act-s35",
   "number": "35",
