   "heading": "Safekeeping during distribution",
   "instrument": "Cannabis Regulations"
  },
  {
   "id": "cannabis-regs-s48",
   "number": "48",
   "text": "A holder of a licence must include their name, as set out in the licence, in all the means by which they identify themself in relation to cannabis, including advertising, purchase orders, shipping documents and invoices.",
