   "number": "104.17",
   "text": "It is prohibited to promote cannabis, a cannabis accessory or a service related to cannabis under paragraphs 17(2)(b) and (3)(b) of the Act in such a manner that the promotion may be audible or visible from outside a place where young persons are not permitted by law.",
   "part": "PART 6.1 Promotion",
   "heading": "Place where young persons are not permitted",
   "instrument": "Cannabis Regulations"
  },
  {
