   "heading": "Hidden features",
   "instrument": "Cannabis Regulations"
  },
  {
   "id": "cannabis-regs-s117",
   "number": "117",
   "text": "The interior surface, exterior surface and panel of any container in which a cannabis product is packaged and any covering of such a container must not be capable of emitting a scent or sound.",
