   "number": "121",
   "text": "(1) The interior surface, exterior surface and panel of any container in which a cannabis product is packaged must not include any cut-out window. (2) Despite subsection (1), any container in which dried cannabis, fresh cannabis or cannabis plant seeds are packaged may include cut-out windows.",
