 the medical document in accordance with subsection 288(1) unless there are reasonable grounds to believe that the date that already appears on the medical document has been falsified. (5) If the holder is, after taking the steps referred to in subparagraph (3)(b)(i) or paragraph (4)(a), unable to determine the date on which the applicant was first registered on the basis of the medical document, they must, if they proceed to register the applicant, indicate on the medical document the information referred to subsection 288(1) in accordance with the requirements set out in that subsection.",
